": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10685, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KmUgycXfC87Z2w7xBHq4NG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12318, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release. v2.3.0 is the most recent release with a healthy production record. Since it has been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Result:** The rollback verified. The service now reports healthy on v2.3.0 in every region, with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18 on v2.3.1.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the rollback and the v2.3.1 failure. It also lists next steps: investigate the v2.3.1 failure before any re-release, and check whether customers were affected during the window.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014KMj6s3gs685P75JpZydn9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Lr2GYBjAertCsxhnL3wgJE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release, and v2.3.0 has a healthy production record, so no change-manager approval is needed. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UtHrn5mzad1WAQgEzg4FYD", "calle